8571	{"artifactId":"LLD-8315a11f29fd2812-s2","entry":{"id":"migrated-LLD-8315a11f29fd2812-s2-review","actor":{"id":"insrc:daemon","kind":"agent","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-19T10:30:19.861Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"warn","summary":"review: warn","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"warn","findings":[{"claimId":"coverage-of-intent.1","ref":"coverage-of-intent","item":"coverage-of-intent","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The design covers S002's three acceptance criteria without adding review criteria.","evidence":"DEF §6.2 requires call/file/module grouping, summaries across chunk boundaries, and whole-symbol review with named oversize failures. The proposed relations, neighbourSummary and prepare integration address these; verdict and gather changes remain outside S002. [files: docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/DEF.md, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/HLD.md]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.1","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Graph grounding contains structured summaries with caller/callee names; diff grounding contains file rows with hunks and empty edges.","evidence":"assembleCodeReviewGrounding assigns 'callers: callers.map(c => c.name)' and the analogous callees array. buildDiffSymbols assigns 'kind: file', 'signature: hunks + truncNote', and empty callers/callees arrays. ChangedSymbolSummary has no module field. [files: src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts, src/workflow/code-review/types.ts]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.2","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The delivered review job packs whole atoms by rendered prompt size without relationship grouping or neighbour summaries.","evidence":"DimensionStrategy supplies symbols and context without relations. planMap measures 'promptChars(strategy.map.messages(syms, ctx, undefined))' and invokes packWithin; packIntoBatches greedily batches items in order. [files: src/workflow/code-review/review-job.ts, src/workflow/code-review/pack-into-batches.ts]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"new-versus-reuse.1","ref":"new-versus-reuse","item":"new-versus-reuse","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"prepareCoverageGrounding is reusable with the stated signature and produces precisely the coverage rows supplied to today's prompt.","evidence":"The function accepts subject, grounding and groundingMode; degraded mode returns empty symbols. Otherwise it filters eligibility and adds coverageEvidence. judgeCoverage and the controller's emitJudgementsResult both pass its output to buildCoveragePrompt. [files: src/workflow/code-review/dimensions/coverage.ts, src/daemon/steps/code-review-step/handler.ts]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"new-versus-reuse.2","ref":"new-versus-reuse","item":"new-versus-reuse","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed material builder and neighbour writer add capabilities absent from the current implementation.","evidence":"Source searches found no codeReviewMaterial or neighbourSummary implementation. The existing Atom/DimensionStrategy contracts and packing implementation contain neither relationship metadata nor neighbour rendering. The proposed review-pipeline directory is not yet implemented. [files: src/workflow/code-review/review-job.ts, src/workflow/code-review/pack-into-batches.ts]","action":"Treat S001's pipeline as a prerequisite, not delivered code.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.1","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed material and neighbour-summary functions fit the upstream shared contracts without changing the grounding assembler or its callers.","evidence":"HLD sc1 defines atoms with id, label, text and optional file/module, plus relations and obligations. S001 §2.21 defines 'neighbourSummary?(atom: ReviewAtom, material: ReviewMaterial): string'. assembleCodeReviewGrounding has the stated three-argument signature; runner and daemon IPC callers consume its unchanged CodeReviewGrounding result. [files: docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/HLD.md, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/S001/LLD.md, src/workflow/code-review/grounding.ts, src/workflow/code-review/runner.ts, src/daemon/index.ts]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"data-compatibility.1","ref":"data-compatibility","item":"data-compatibility","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Building material from existing summary fields requires no grounding migration and preserves compatibility with summaries lacking coverage eligibility.","evidence":"The required identity, file, kind, name, signature and edge arrays already exist. coverageEligible and coverageEvidence are optional. prepareCoverageGrounding uses 's.coverageEligible ?? isCoverageEligible(s.kind, s.file)', and existing fixtures exercise legacy rows without the flag. [files: src/workflow/code-review/types.ts, src/workflow/code-review/dimensions/coverage.ts, src/workflow/code-review/dimensions/__tests__/coverage-evidence.test.ts]","action":"Retain the legacy-row coverage fixture when testing the material builder.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"boundaries.1","ref":"boundaries","item":"boundaries","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"S002 owns material relationships and neighbour text while S001 owns packing and S003 owns obligations, prompts and gather.","evidence":"HLD §5.2 explicitly assigns 'changed-symbol atoms' and 'how neighbour summaries are written' to S002. S001 specifies grouping order and direction-independent grouping. S003 specifies obligations/context 'added to s2’s codeReviewMaterial output by each dimension’s adapter'. [files: docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/HLD.md, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/S001/LLD.md, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/S003/LLD.md]","action":"None.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"error-paths.1","ref":"error-paths","item":"error-paths","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The upstream implementation guarantees the specified neighbour-free lower-bound oversize check before provider calls.","evidence":"The existing packer throws AtomTooLargeError with atom, size and budget, and S001's design promises named oversize failures. However, the shared pipeline is not implemented, so its neighbour-aware packing and the claimed lower-bound check cannot be verified in code. The analyzer also failed with shaper-llm-unavailable after a provider schema rejection. [files: src/workflow/code-review/pack-into-batches.ts, src/workflow/code-review/review-job.ts, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/S001/LLD.md]","action":"Make the specified singleton and neighbour-co-location regression tests prerequisites for accepting S001/S002 integration.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"could-not-verify"},{"claimId":"tests.1","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Each upstream S002 acceptance criterion maps to an explicit proposed test.","evidence":"Compared DEF S002/ac1–ac3 with the LLD mapping: ac1 has relation-priority and rendered-fit tests; ac2 has summaries on both sides of a cut; ac3 has whole-atom conservation and named oversize tests. Existing grounding and coverage tests use node:test and node:assert/strict as proposed. This verifies the test plan, not passing implementation tests. [files: docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/DEF.md, docs/epics/chunked-review-pipeline-every-review-E202610198315a11f/S002/LLD.md, src/workflow/code-review/__tests__/grounding.test.ts, src/workflow/code-review/dimensions/__tests__/coverage-evidence.test.ts]","action":"Implement and run the mapped tests after the S001 prepare seam is available.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":0,"low":10,"unverified":1},"template":"design-spec","reviewedAt":"2026-10-19T10:30:19.861Z","model":"cli-codex:gpt-6-astra","reviewedBy":"daemon"},"resolutions":{}}}}}
